~ start
if not GameState.talked_to_gary:
	Garry: Hi Taiyaki its been a while Glep told me you were coming
	Garry: Last time I saw you was when you were tiny kitten
	Garry: Have how you been
	- Who are you?
		Garry: Oh you dont remeber
	- Im confuesed where am I?
		Garry: Oh you dont remmeber
	Garry: I was told about the incident
	- The incident?
		Garry: Oh nothing
	- What?
		Garry: Dont worry about it
	Garry: Im Garry btw
	Garry: Here I need some help pushing boxes
	Garry: My dwarf body has grown weak and cant get up [wait=1] you just need to push the box to the indicaated spot
	Garry: Use arrow keys to move the boxes if you get stuck use e to reset
	$> GameState.talked_to_gary = true 
	
	$> get_tree().change_scene_to_file("res://minigame2/level0.tscn")

elif not GameState.talked_to_gary_final:
	Garry: Hey thanks
	Garry: Well I do want to say your owner is here 
	Garry: Atleast that is what I was told
	Garry: He was a nice guy
	Garry: Head more inward into the forrest
	Garry: You will meet [wave]Taya[/wave] she will be in the river
	Garry: She is a fish
	Garry: Visit sometime Taiyaki
	$> GameState.talked_to_gary_final = true
	
else :
	Garry: Whats up taiyaki?
	Garry: Hope things are going well
	Garry: Hey keep up the good work
	Garry: Your always welcome here
	Garry: You better get going this mystery isnt goign to solve itself
	
=> END